title: "Rigged African Elephant Bull for Blender"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A free, anatomically rigged 3D African bush elephant bull (Loxodonta africana)
  for Blender, with a 107-joint skeleton and 5 science-based animations:
  idle, walk, run, eating and threat & charge.
authors:
  - name: "AnimalAnimator"
    website: "https://animalanimator.com/"
version: "3.0"
date-released: 2026-10-22
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://animalanimator.com/the-ultimate-african-elephant-for-animal-animators/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/animalanimator/african-elephant-rig-blender"
keywords:
  - african elephant
  - Loxodonta africana
  - 3D model
  - Blender
  - rigging
  - animal animation
  - walk cycle
  - biomechanics
